  "interpretation": "Socrates proposes Forms as paradigms and other things as likenesses, making participation being likened to them. This is a directed proposal whose conversion into symmetric generic resemblance is made explicit in the following exchange. Bounded reading of the materialized Greek witness. Retained as prose; it is not silently equated with the stronger universal Lean reconstruction.",
